raph","text":"ウ"}]}},{"id":"choice-original-4","content":{"attribution":{"origin":"official","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"source-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-qs","locator":{"year":2014,"period":"秋期","exam":"基本情報技術者試験","timeSlot":"午前","subject":"旧制度・午前","section":"平成26年度 秋期 基本情報技術者試験 午前 問55","page":24,"questionNumber":"55"}}],"rightsRefs":["rights-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-55"],"creatorIds":["ipa"]},"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"エ"}]}}],"correctAnswer":{"choiceId":"choice-original-4","attribution":{"origin":"official","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"source-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-ans","locator":{"year":2014,"period":"秋期","exam":"基本情報技術者試験","timeSlot":"午前","subject":"旧制度・午前","section":"平成26年度 秋期 基本情報技術者試験 午前 問55 解答例","page":1,"questionNumber":"55"}}],"rightsRefs":["rights-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-55"],"creatorIds":["ipa"]}},"explanation":{"attribution":{"origin":"original","sourceRefs":[{"sourceId":"source-pmi-risk-response-2014-autumn-am-55","locator":{"section":"脅威と好機への対応戦略"}},{"sourceId":"source-pmi-pmbok-fourth-edition-2014-autumn-am-55","locator":{"section":"第4版 §§11.5.2.1–2（pp.303–305）"}}],"rightsRefs":["rights-original"],"creatorIds":["codex"]},"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"受容は，脅威のある計画を続け，発生に備えたり発生後に対応したりする戦略である。活用は好機を実現させ，強化は好機の可能性や効果を高め，共有は好機を共同で実現する。受容は脅威と好機の両方に適用できる。四肢の中で脅威にも適用できるのは受容である。"}]},"assetRefs":["asset-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-55","asset-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-common-2","asset-ipa-2014h26a-fe-am-common-3"],"choiceShuffleAllowed":false,"distribution":"included","review":{"checkedOn":"2026-11-21","reviewerIds":["codex"],"checks":{"publication":"pass","terms":"pass","thirdParty":"pass","transcription":"pass","answer":"pass","explanation":"pass"},"notes":"原冊子p.24の問55だけを切り出した。四肢は一般的な戦略名。PMBOK及び関連文献の定義文・表・図・例題・ロゴを同梱せず、文献は原四肢の分類の照合に参照した。公開Git・ブラウザ配信・生成にIPAの作問部分と独立解説のみを用いる。脅威に適用する戦略名を四肢から一つ選ぶ形式を維持する。原条件の受容に加え、計画変更による回避、第三者への移転、発生可能性の低減を独立した本文例で問う。各事例の3つの誤答は好機の戦略。"}},{"schemaVersion":"3.0.0","id":"question-template-source-2014h26a-fe-am-55","revision":1,"lifecycle":"active","subject":